<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">ICCAD'27: IEEE/IFAC - 11th International Conference on Control, Automation and Diagnosis</div><div id="cfpvenue">ESTACA</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Paris, France, July 6-8, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://www.iccad-conf.com/" target="_blank">https://www.iccad-conf.com/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=iccad27" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=iccad27</a></td></tr><tr><td>Abstract registration deadline</td><td>January 31, 2027</td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>January 31, 2027</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=9295" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_aqua">control</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=12337" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_fuchsia bg_palegoldenrod">automation</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=750" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_navy bg_darksalmon">robotics</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=44288746" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_darkred bg_palegoldenrod">diagosis</span></a></div><p>ICCAD’27 will be held in July 6-8, 2027 in Paris, France. Our conference is a forum for presenting excellent results and new challenges facing the field of the reliability and availability of Control, Automation and Diagnosis. It brings together experts from industry, governments and academia, experienced in engineering, design and research. This conference will provide a remarkable opportunity for the academic and industrial communities to address new challenges, share solutions and discuss future research directions. The technical program will include plenary lectures, regular technical sessions, and special sessions.</p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p>All papers must be original and not simultaneously submitted to another journal or conference. The following paper categories are welcome.</p><ul><li><strong>Full papers</strong> : <strong>All papers must be written in English and should describe original work. The length of the paper is limited to a maximum of 6 pages (in the standard IEEE conference double column format).</strong></li></ul><h2>List of Topics</h2><ul><li><p>Control Theory and Applications</p></li><li><p>Automation and Industrial Systems</p></li><li><p>Fault Detection, Diagnosis, and Fault-Tolerant Control</p></li><li><p>System Identification, Estimation, and Monitoring</p></li><li><p>Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning for Control and Diagnosis</p></li><li><p>Robotics, Autonomous Systems, and Intelligent Vehicles</p></li><li><p>Intelligent Transportation Systems and Connected Vehicles</p></li><li><p>Predictive Maintenance and Industrial Digitalization</p></li><li><p>Signal Processing and Image Analysis</p></li><li><p>Optimization, Decision Support, and Intelligent Systems</p></li><li><p>Cyber-Physical Systems and Industrial Internet of Things</p></li><li><p>Applications of Control and Automation in Energy, Transportation, and Industry</p></li></ul><h2>Committees</h2><h3>Program Committee</h3><p><strong>Bilal Amghar, </strong>ESTACA in Paris, France</p><p><strong>Rachid Bennacer, </strong>Vice-President of University Paris-Saclay, France</p><p><strong>Fernando Viadero-Monasterio, </strong>Universidad Carlos III de Madrid, Spain</p><p><strong>Ahmed Chemori, </strong>University of Montpellier, CNRS, France</p><p><strong>Mehrez Abdellaoui, </strong>University of Sousse, Tunisia</p><p><strong>Francesco Bianconi,</strong> University of Perugia, Italy</p><h3>Organizing Committee</h3><p><strong>Bilal Amghar, France</strong></p><p><strong>Toufik Azib, France</strong></p><p><strong>Chakib Ben Njima, Tunisia</strong></p><p><strong>Rabia Sehab, France</strong></p><h2>Publication</h2><p>ICCAD'27 proceedings will be published in IEEE Xplore</p><h2>Venue</h2><p>The conference will be held at ESTACA in Paris</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>All questions about submissions should be emailed to: contact@iccad-conf.com</p><h2> </h2></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
